                <pb facs="0191" n="185" xml:id="pg185"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Webb to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-27"><hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received April 27.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Russian minister, Washington, authorized to sign arrangement annexed to your
                    instruction of March 30. Russian Government ready to enter into
                    negotiations.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
